{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52","id":"pg_157aa063c7a65af6a19fab9c3ed3654b","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-coven-docs-plans-coven-slack-rs-design-md-36edb5c206af-ab9c3ed3654b.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_cfa9b19414fc5d869b4b33cc99e86d4c"],"title":"2389-research/coven/docs/plans/coven-slack-rs/design.md @ 36edb5c206af","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_72e8b026f5814980f94e0f0da52ee12409a7a6d5b4b572dc6015125b7eaa8bf3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Crate dependencies are layered: coven-proto, coven-ssh, and coven-swarm-core have no internal deps; coven-agent depends on coven-core, coven-pack, coven-grpc, and coven-proto."},{"claim_ids":["clm_73e03157c9b13834c9ab42320ebf792775bb9de1f0043a8fc3e3943996ca0424"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"coven-agent run accepts --name and --working-dir (required), plus --gateway (default localhost:50051), --backend (mux/cli), --display (quiet/normal/verbose), and --config options."},{"claim_ids":["clm_868d98e2599b6b5edc43009448ec6e19a25579c99ecb6750a617480e95b5bff3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Configuration lives under ~/.config/coven/ (config.toml, per-agent TOML files, swarm config) with data in ~/.local/share/coven/; the AgentMetadata struct includes hostname, OS, git info, workspaces, and backend fields."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9a8f4695f1d474d673911420d4e99900af4bfd0feea9ba847c2f246c96dd81fe"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Prerequisites include Rust 1.75+, Go 1.21+ for the gateway, protoc, and an Anthropic API key; the mux backend requires ANTHROPIC_API_KEY while the cli backend requires an authenticated claude CLI."}],"claim_ids":["clm_72e8b026f5814980f94e0f0da52ee12409a7a6d5b4b572dc6015125b7eaa8bf3","clm_73e03157c9b13834c9ab42320ebf792775bb9de1f0043a8fc3e3943996ca0424","clm_868d98e2599b6b5edc43009448ec6e19a25579c99ecb6750a617480e95b5bff3","clm_9a8f4695f1d474d673911420d4e99900af4bfd0feea9ba847c2f246c96dd81fe"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52","id":"pg_7aa91d787ed15268a153ccab5f590526","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-coven-docs-agent-md-36edb5c206af-ccab5f590526.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_f2c141fb5ce75fecbd0a181255e026cb"],"title":"2389-research/coven/docs/agent.md @ 36edb5c206af","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1472a2d327a4a10c7db33eb840a1d53c4a3766deeb6f0b800f00298177e91c4c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"coven-swarm provides a supervisor command for multi-workspace orchestration, documented as spawning agents per workspace."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4db38509841e9716be85ec09dbe73641ccdc9e6540acd588791ad9afdce9197b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project comprises a Rust monorepo (agents, CLI, TUI, packs), a Go gateway server for routing, storage and pack registry, and shared Protobuf definitions (coven-proto)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5799f746f16d09a9cbae122272d28b5927634007dcb7bc2a887237151e401e9c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Coven is described as a Rust-based platform for orchestrating AI agents with tool capabilities, connecting Claude-powered agents to a central gateway."},{"claim_ids":["clm_816c30eb36f29cb2ed2cb296810b4f0cd6a4f5a9f480536df20938708c378859"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The gateway exposes an HTTP server with SSE events, a gRPC server for agent streams, and a pack service acting as a tool registry, backed by SQLite."},{"claim_ids":["clm_868d98e2599b6b5edc43009448ec6e19a25579c99ecb6750a617480e95b5bff3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Configuration lives under ~/.config/coven/ (config.toml, per-agent TOML files, swarm config) with data in ~/.local/share/coven/; the AgentMetadata struct includes hostname, OS, git info, workspaces, and backend fields."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9a8f4695f1d474d673911420d4e99900af4bfd0feea9ba847c2f246c96dd81fe"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Prerequisites include Rust 1.75+, Go 1.21+ for the gateway, protoc, and an Anthropic API key; the mux backend requires ANTHROPIC_API_KEY while the cli backend requires an authenticated claude CLI."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a4d13de73130a2b5d860a86d65a56dd59bac6c71abe21007d58f59b62898feef"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: components are built via make targets (make coven, make coven-agent, make coven-swarm) or installed with cargo install from crate paths; the gateway is built in a separate coven-gateway repository."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b6b8dbc159d2e78cc113998f49e5b76e4aee3c273d656907047c2715228beb19"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: development uses make targets (check+test+clippy, build, release, test, clippy, fmt), and CLAUDE.md is referenced for detailed development guidelines."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1472a2d327a4a10c7db33eb840a1d53c4a3766deeb6f0b800f00298177e91c4c","clm_4db38509841e9716be85ec09dbe73641ccdc9e6540acd588791ad9afdce9197b","clm_5799f746f16d09a9cbae122272d28b5927634007dcb7bc2a887237151e401e9c","clm_816c30eb36f29cb2ed2cb296810b4f0cd6a4f5a9f480536df20938708c378859","clm_868d98e2599b6b5edc43009448ec6e19a25579c99ecb6750a617480e95b5bff3","clm_9a8f4695f1d474d673911420d4e99900af4bfd0feea9ba847c2f246c96dd81fe","clm_a4d13de73130a2b5d860a86d65a56dd59bac6c71abe21007d58f59b62898feef","clm_b6b8dbc159d2e78cc113998f49e5b76e4aee3c273d656907047c2715228beb19"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52","id":"pg_98e0610b570450138cee3e763cbc9cf8","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-coven-readme-md-36edb5c206af-3e763cbc9cf8.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_b1123ce7cf885c28b57a4a28eb90d930"],"title":"2389-research/coven/README.md @ 36edb5c206af","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_061d969f711d921258787d17bb55eb538c4b88be8313511b5763ffa19342240c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Authorization is documented so agents can access only their own sessions, pack tools carry explicit permission scopes, and admin endpoints require separate authentication."},{"claim_ids":["clm_0a17687afa11ca103f509ccfa23f8f74c52e055d89b9416cf9aa916473dfa0f3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The gRPC protocol defines a bidirectional AgentStream service; AgentMessage payloads are RegisterAgent, MessageResponse, and Heartbeat, while ServerMessage payloads are Welcome, SendMessage, and Shutdown."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1472a2d327a4a10c7db33eb840a1d53c4a3766deeb6f0b800f00298177e91c4c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"coven-swarm provides a supervisor command for multi-workspace orchestration, documented as spawning agents per workspace."},{"claim_ids":["clm_34e17f71863776f344fe195c92924d20db7c4074ff7de6cda326a394b4260df0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The gateway stores threads (frontend-to-agent session mappings), messages (conversation history), and bindings (channel-to-agent routing) in SQLite; agents keep a local threads.db cache and session state."},{"claim_ids":["clm_378556347b3f70811a59a010e8818e530e29ea2f988331455d56142c08b1ec51"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agents register with the gateway over gRPC, receive a Welcome containing session_id and configuration, then send heartbeats every 30 seconds while the gateway tracks last_seen."},{"claim_ids":["clm_72e8b026f5814980f94e0f0da52ee12409a7a6d5b4b572dc6015125b7eaa8bf3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Crate dependencies are layered: coven-proto, coven-ssh, and coven-swarm-core have no internal deps; coven-agent depends on coven-core, coven-pack, coven-grpc, and coven-proto."},{"claim_ids":["clm_afe2f329b3968455daab45c63b955a463b7b39f933c1e9106ff9480356c1f9ea"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agent responses stream as ordered events: Thinking, Text, ToolUse, ToolResult, Done, and Error."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d90c00299d4d226a53e117ec80780e58c98d17014906f89330a0d13effbbf2f5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agents use pluggable LLM backends behind an async Backend trait returning a stream of events; documented backends include MuxBackend (direct Anthropic API), DirectCliBackend (claude CLI subprocess), and AcpBackend."}],"claim_ids":["clm_061d969f711d921258787d17bb55eb538c4b88be8313511b5763ffa19342240c","clm_0a17687afa11ca103f509ccfa23f8f74c52e055d89b9416cf9aa916473dfa0f3","clm_1472a2d327a4a10c7db33eb840a1d53c4a3766deeb6f0b800f00298177e91c4c","clm_34e17f71863776f344fe195c92924d20db7c4074ff7de6cda326a394b4260df0","clm_378556347b3f70811a59a010e8818e530e29ea2f988331455d56142c08b1ec51","clm_72e8b026f5814980f94e0f0da52ee12409a7a6d5b4b572dc6015125b7eaa8bf3","clm_afe2f329b3968455daab45c63b955a463b7b39f933c1e9106ff9480356c1f9ea","clm_d90c00299d4d226a53e117ec80780e58c98d17014906f89330a0d13effbbf2f5"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52","id":"pg_deccef2493c3549d9f5651d85d2dd02d","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-coven-docs-architecture-md-36edb5c206af-51d85d2dd02d.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_de0cdd2be5075a92859ff71c24a054d7"],"title":"2389-research/coven/docs/architecture.md @ 36edb5c206af","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_a4d13de73130a2b5d860a86d65a56dd59bac6c71abe21007d58f59b62898feef"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: components are built via make targets (make coven, make coven-agent, make coven-swarm) or installed with cargo install from crate paths; the gateway is built in a separate coven-gateway repository."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b3ee8a2aac4a307b617549362cfe3afaa4c6186f5bdb58b187c53f2ba865652b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The coven CLI offers chat, agent, swarm, pack, and config commands; chat supports --agent, --thread, and --gateway options plus slash commands like /quit, /clear, and /switch."}],"claim_ids":["clm_a4d13de73130a2b5d860a86d65a56dd59bac6c71abe21007d58f59b62898feef","clm_b3ee8a2aac4a307b617549362cfe3afaa4c6186f5bdb58b187c53f2ba865652b"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52","id":"pg_ee501ecf96fc5f15a9a773a5a4f59a65","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/2389-research-coven-docs-cli-md-36edb5c206af-73a5a4f59a65.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_9ac7b0955db55229a2c2ae18331710ed"],"title":"2389-research/coven/docs/cli.md @ 36edb5c206af","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:26:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_fffa913838404f5bbd3cc6cedea07a52"}
